# Example build-time environment for calc. Copy to `.env` (which is
# git-ignored) and fill in as needed. All vars are optional — the app builds
# and runs without any of them. See `docs/configuration.md` for the full list.

# Dropbox app key (PKCE public client). Unset hides the Dropbox storage
# backend in Settings → Storage. Register an app at
# https://www.dropbox.com/developers/apps (scoped access, "App folder").
# VITE_DROPBOX_APP_KEY=

# Dropbox app-folder name (`Apps/<name>/`), fixed by your Dropbox app config.
# Defaults to "Calc"; set it when your app folder differs.
# VITE_DROPBOX_APP_FOLDER=Calc


# `demo` boots onto the demo shelf: eight saved sessions held in memory, and
# nothing read from or written to this browser's storage. `make demo` runs the
# dev server this way; the store screenshots are taken of this build.
# VITE_SEED=demo
